.google.com/drive/folders/1-LwQrBoNo-irVswWoWacyPHbtg-AuBKv", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@morikoekaki_08/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/24e95547/uploads/origins/94118e05-e96e-44d6-beab-091860314fab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=afeb24b523df773c84391ded777651d4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/24e95547/uploads/origins/94118e05-e96e-44d6-beab-091860314fab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=afeb24b523df773c84391ded777651d4, https://si.imgix.net/24e95547/uploads/origins/94118e05-e96e-44d6-beab-091860314fab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5b3a89dd2f4b52819fc128428d54a78 2x, https://si.imgix.net/24e95547/uploads/origins/94118e05-e96e-44d6-beab-091860314fab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db6047558c4999b3341ed32096ac786d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私はあなたの作品が本当に大好きです。\n\n私と私の仲良しの友達を描いてくれませんか？\n私は本当にかわいい＆甘いものが好きです。\n\n16:9の比率で、レイヤーを分けてください。\n\n必要であれば、価格を上げてください\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-LJzQPKJWACgqJ1OAQeb4lGhdEmjYl2R", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@morikoekaki_08/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a291319f/uploads/origins/e8c8991d-8248-4215-92bb-f2f0c7be0bb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc2db3936dda056cb16df8de7a6bedfb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a291319f/uploads/origins/e8c8991d-8248-4215-92bb-f2f0c7be0bb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc2db3936dda056cb16df8de7a6bedfb, https://si.imgix.net/a291319f/uploads/origins/e8c8991d-8248-4215-92bb-f2f0c7be0bb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=293c8a11005f73063a27584544697cd9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a291319f/uploads/origins/e8c8991d-8248-4215-92bb-f2f0c7be0bb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccomp